dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.npc = Twiggy
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.role = gardener
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.accueil = Oh! A seed walking on two legs! Welcome under our leaves, traveller.
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.accueil.qui = Who are you?
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.tableau = Show me the village board.
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.aurevoir = Goodbye.
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.presentation = Twiggy, at your service! I sing for the sprouts, and the sprouts sing for me.
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.aider = Can I help the village?
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.aplustard = See you later.
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.aide = The village hungers for seeds. Three carrot seeds, and the grove will be grateful!
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.aide.donner = Here are three seeds.
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.aide.donner.hint = give 3 carrot seeds, +10 growth
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.aide.donner.fail = you need 3 carrot seeds, in a village
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.reviendrai = I will come back.
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.merci = Your seeds are singing already! Here, some apples for the road.
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.merci.cadeau = Thank you, Twiggy.
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.merci.cadeau.hint = receive 2 apples
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.merci.cadeau.fail = you already got your gift
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.retour = There you are again, wandering seed! The wind brought you back.
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.nouvelles = How is the village?
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.nouvelles.fail = the village must be at least a hamlet
dialogue.Kweebec_Essai.nouvelles.message = Twiggy hums: the hamlet's roofs grow like mushrooms after rain.

